        "## One-Operator / One-Labeler Dry Run",
        "",
        "- Operator:",
        "- Labeler:",
        "- Recording:",
        "- Task:",
        "- Browser smoke evidence template is filled and archived by the operator:",
        "- `record-browser-smoke-evidence` update report is archived:",
        "- Labeler sees only assigned recording:",
        "- Save event ID:",
        "- Completion verified:",
